WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.982
I learn English.

2
00:00:07.982 --> 00:00:11.874
I'm only a beginner.

3
00:00:13.874 --> 00:00:20.770
I still make many mistakes.

4
00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:27.472
I don't understand the word.

5
00:00:29.472 --> 00:00:34.958
I don't understand the meaning.

6
00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:40.850
I've forgotten it.

7
00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:49.250
I don't remember the name right now.

8
00:00:53.250 --> 00:01:01.531
Learning languages is interesting.

9
00:01:03.531 --> 00:01:13.536
Yes, and I also speak some Italian.

10
00:01:15.536 --> 00:01:22.223
The languages are quite similar.

11
00:01:24.223 --> 00:01:30.205
I can understand them well.

12
00:01:34.205 --> 00:01:39.795
We are learning a language.

13
00:01:41.795 --> 00:01:48.874
We want to understand people.

14
00:01:50.874 --> 00:01:59.468
We want to speak with people.

15
00:02:01.468 --> 00:02:06.849
He studies languages.

16
00:02:08.849 --> 00:02:15.145
He speaks several languages.

17
00:02:19.145 --> 00:02:26.041
You learn Spanish.

18
00:02:28.041 --> 00:02:35.930
I think you speak very well.

19
00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:41.535
Where do you come from?

20
00:02:43.535 --> 00:02:52.234
Are you taking a language course?

21
00:02:54.234 --> 00:03:00.033
Your pronunciation is very good.
